{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD STRONG TEAM OF FARMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy farmers and items for them to equip. Always make the most of the resources you have and seek for better combinations of characters and their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/charming_farm_1.gif?t=1740559939\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AUTOMATIC BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you continue your journey, you will be forced to face enemies in automatic battle. Hope you prepare well.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/charming_farm_2.gif?t=1740559939\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RECOVER FALLEN FARMERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the battle, you will need to decide whether to spend the valuable mushrooms on recovering farmers who fell in battle or save it to upgrade your team later.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/charming_farm_3.gif?t=1740559939\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MOST POWERFUL ITEMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are a lot of ways to get loot in this game. But to get the most powerful items you must look for secrets, use unobvious strategies and truly think outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/extras/anim_4.gif?t=1740559939\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832530?t=1740559939","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832530?t=1740559939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832530/55e532d1ea69ceb4837b35518f4dacdfdfa